PART C -- coherent context merge monotonicity
  Observable: context_delta(partition) - all_singleton_delta at total size 7.
  tested=329, failures=0, min_context=20/16807 (0.001189980) at ('coordinate', 3, (0, 1, 3), '[1+1+1+1]')
  min(context-singleton lift)=0 (0.000000000) at ('coordinate', 3, (0, 1, 3), '[1+1+1+1]')
  all observed coherent contexts are at least as strong as all-singletons;
  equality occurs at the all-singleton partition, as expected.

